\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">6 Inch Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>6 inch submersible pump Our products are supplied to environmental protection, waste water treatment, water supply and drainage, mining and so on. The products are distributed all over China and far away to Europe, U.S., Pakistan and so forth. 6 inch submersible pump is one of our major...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52188317\"/></p><p><strong>6 inch submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241407587617268.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Our products are supplied to environmental protection, waste water treatment, water supply and drainage, mining and so on. The products are distributed all over China and far away to Europe, U.S., Pakistan and so forth. 6 inch submersible pump is one of our major products.</p><p><strong>1. Products Specification</strong></p><p>Pump</p><p>Max flow: 84m³/h</p><p>Capacity：0-70 m³/h</p><p>Length：1161-2522 m</p><p><strong>Motor</strong></p><p>Adopt the NEMA standard</p><p>Continuous service</p><p>Power: 4kw-22kw/5.5-30hp</p><p>Insulation class: F</p><p>Protection grade: IP 68</p><p>Maximum well diameter: 143mm</p><p>Highest temperature of liquid: 35 ℃</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241409195820653.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241407558373806.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare parts</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image011.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241410083586519.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>4. Packing &amp; Shipping</strong></p><p>Packaging Details:</p><p>Square carton (Inner with Tube carton + Outer Square carton)</p><p>Wooden case</p><p>According to your condition.</p><p>Delivery Detail: </p><p>Depend on the amount of the order. </p><p>Usually about 20-30 days.</p><p><strong>5. Company Information</strong></p><p>1. More than30 years of experience</p><p>2. Over 300 highly skilled workers</p><p>3. Professional engineers</p><p>4. Advanced pumps production machines</p><p>5.100,000 sets per year</p><p><strong>6. Our Services</strong></p><p>1. Each product will be properly tested and packed by hand.</p><p>2. Answer your question ASAP within 24 hours</p><p>3. Customized design is available.</p><p>4. Exclusive and unique solutions will be given to our customer by our well-trained and professional engineers.</p><p>5. Different requirements of the pump will be accepted.</p><p><strong>7. Product Certification</strong> </p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411154549302.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411169751193.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. What about the warranty of your products?</strong></p><p>A: 1 year started from the date you bought the product.</p><p><strong>2. Q: What basic information is needed for selecting a submersible pump?</strong></p><p>A: Flow: The request of water within one minute/hour. Whether the well is able to produce enough water to meet the requirements is also important. Head: The vertical dimension from the pump suction chamber to water pipe final outlet.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Is customized service available?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, OEM&amp;ODM is available. Tell our salesman about your requirement.  </p><p><strong>4. Q: What's your MOQ?</strong></p><p>A: Sample for testing is available. Usually 50 pieces at least.</p><p><strong><br/></strong></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 6 inch submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-screw-pump/3-diameter-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"3 Diameter Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-diameter-submersible-pump45449414849a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-screw-pump/3-diameter-submersible-pump\">3 Diameter Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-submersible-screw-pump/single-phase-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Single Phase Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/single-phase-submersible-pump21125879593a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-submersible-screw-pump/single-phase-submersible-pump\">Single Phase Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-peripheral-submersible-pump/high-cost-performance-submeisible-pump\"><img alt=\"High Cost Performance Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/high-cost-performance-submeisible-pump53170658355a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-peripheral-submersible-pump/high-cost-performance-submeisible-pump\">High Cost Performance Sub